OL,3,ASwedish PM Kristersson resigns after
OL,4,Aelection loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweden's Prime Minister Ulf Kristersson
OL,7,Fhas resigned after his ruling
OL,8,Fright-wing bloc was narrowly defeated
OL,9,Fby the centre-left opposition in the
OL,10,Fcountry's general election.
OL,12,FHe made the announcement in a post on X
OL,13,Fon Thursday afternoon, after
OL,14,Fpreliminary votes from Sunday's
OL,15,Felection showed about 50,000 votes
OL,16,Fseparated the two blocs in the country
OL,17,Fof about 10 million people.
OL,19,FOpposition parties led by Magdalena
OL,20,FAndersson of the Social Democrats look
OL,21,Fset to win 176 seats in the 349-seat
OL,22,FRiksdag, Sweden's parliament.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
