OL,3,ASwedish PM Kristersson resigns after
OL,4,Aelection loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FKristersson, a conservative, had been
OL,7,Fsupported in government by the
OL,8,Fanti-immigration hard-right Sweden
OL,9,FDemocrats (SD), and had promised them
OL,10,Fcabinet jobs if he won the election.
